---
description: Vault conventions for notes under 02_Inbox
globs: 02_Inbox/**
alwaysApply: false
---

New Inbox notes are named YYYY-MM-DD-descriptive-slug.md, carry frontmatter
with title, tags (including audience/agent and workflow/draft), and updated,
and are never moved out of 02_Inbox without human approval. Run
`python3 10_Agents/tools/brain/brain.py validate` before committing.
